---
description: Run lint, typecheck, and format checks after code changes
alwaysApply: true
---

After modifying code files, run from the repo root before finishing the task:

```bash
pnpm lint && pnpm typecheck && pnpm format:check
```

Fix all reported issues. Before marking work complete, run:

```bash
pnpm check
```

Use `pnpm format` to auto-fix Prettier issues. Use `pnpm test:changed` for fast test
iteration when you changed behavior covered by tests.
